==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{m|non|tuttugu}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*twai tigiwiz}}.

===Numeral===
'''tuttugu'''

# '''[[twenty]]'''; the cardinal number after [[nítján#Icelandic|nítján]] and before [[tuttugu og einn#Icelandic|tuttugu og einn]].

====Related terms====
* {{sense|ordinal form}} {{l|is|tuttugasti|g=m}}, [[tuttugasta]] {{g|f|n}}.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|twenty}} {{l|is|tvítján}}

